    ],
    "explanation": "payment-svc reloaded CARDPROC_API_KEY at version 7 and the previous version was revoked (line 123); the new value is not one the card processor accepts, so every call gets 401 Unauthorized (lines 129, 137, 142). A 401 is the provider answering correctly, not an outage. order-service's 502s (lines 125, 172) and api-gateway's (lines 126, 143, 153, 168) are symptoms. Red herrings: line 38 (a one-off slow reporting query on audit_log, not on the failing request path).",
    "difficulty": "easy",
    "acceptableCauses": [],
    "scenario": "config_error/rotated-credential"
  }
